[A Alliance] South-east across the dunes to the Caverns of Time [G51.0,29.3 Tanaris][G57.0,35.9 Tanaris][G62.2,43.7 Tanaris][G63.9,46.3 Tanaris][G65.3,50.0 Tanaris] [OC] \\ Scorpids, basilisks and Wastewander bandits (level 40-46) on the way; the rare Murderous Blisterpaw (elite 43) can roam near 52.3,33.3.
